{"id":1050802,"chapter_id":1050802,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"辽阔的砂海一望无际，正午的烈阳在火热的砂上氤氲起扭曲的阳炎，几乎没有什么活物会在这个时候在砂上行走。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"而这个男人是个例外。他身上穿着从商队那里偷来的砂海行衣，厚实的隔热层和循环降温机能成为了支撑他孤身一人穿越砂海的基本希望。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"刚出发时作为最大辎重的行囊如今已经空荡荡，只有最后的一瓶水和几块压缩饼干。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"<i>哈……哈……今天是第几天？第……19天？</i>","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"<i>先前抢的那辆货车是不错，东坏一点西坏一点也都还能开，要不是没燃料了，我也不会丢了它。</i>","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"<i>之后又走了很久，我没算时间。用腿走太慢，但我们早就习惯了，对吧，艾芙洛，以前对抗砂盗和天灾的时候，我们也是这样徒步行军的。</i>","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"男人像是仍背着什么沉重的包袱一样，停下来颠了颠背上的行囊，重又拉紧背带间的束带。手背上狰狞的伤痕清晰可见。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"<i>没有武器装备，也没有脑子正常的指挥官……当然也没有异方晶。我们那时候可羡慕狄斯的FAC了，听说他们每个人都能分到不少。</i>","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"<i>但有什么办法呢，穷苦小邦只能靠我们这群人去填命，一个接一个。你们死了之后，队伍没坚持多久就彻底乱了……哈，我这才找机会逃了出来。</i>","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"<i>然后我就撞见了那个叫蓝鹫的女人和她的车队。她说能带我去狄斯，去过我们天天说的“太平的好日子”，但是需要跟她做个交易。</i>","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"<i>去他的交易。那女人根本没想去狄斯。还骗我，她以为我是谁。她那车队最没用的就是她。</i>","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"肉体和精神都已濒临崩溃，虚无的希望夹杂着尖锐的恨意灌满了双腿。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"<i>我能自己偷车偷水和粮食，还能顺上货物。那辆车上的定位装置我也拆下来了。</i>","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"<i>等我去到狄斯，把这件衣服一卖，就有本钱留在那里了。</i>","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"<i>当时，要是有这种衣服就好了，哪怕贵一点，这样……贝玛尔就不会死了。</i>","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"“艾芙洛”","content":"对啊，走快点吧莱曼。你可一定要带着我们的愿望到达狄斯啊。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"他抬起手揉了揉眼睛，扭动的阳炎之中，依稀有几个熟悉的身影在摇曳。他们冲他招手，还有人来到他面前想要伸手拉他。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"“贝玛尔”","content":"走啊莱曼。我们是去不成了，但你要到狄斯去，替我们看看那片土地。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"<i>……你们这群混蛋。</i>","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"——伊帕希娅大人。","style":3,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"<i>先别走，多陪我一段……</i>","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"守卫","content":"报告长官，有个人穿越砂海过来了。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802023,"trial_step":23},{"step":23,"speaker":"事务官","content":"人？不是车队什么的？那里可是无人区，一个人要怎么穿越？","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802024,"trial_step":24},{"step":24,"speaker":"守卫","content":"确实是一个人，四周没有发现异常情况，M值在安全范围。也许是意外失散的逃难者。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802025,"trial_step":25},{"step":25,"speaker":"事务官","content":"也可能是伪装成人形的死役，或者是异邦的间谍……总之不要放松警惕，我们去会一会他。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802026,"trial_step":26},{"step":26,"content":"边境的城墙之下。莱曼精神恍惚地仰起头，只看到了高耸的、隔绝一切的城墙。","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802027,"trial_step":27},{"step":27,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"这就是……狄斯……","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802028,"trial_step":28},{"step":28,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"我们的梦想……即将实现的地方……","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802029,"trial_step":29},{"step":29,"content":"还没等他回神，就有几名荷枪实弹的士兵来到他的面前。","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802030,"trial_step":30},{"step":30,"speaker":"守卫","content":"姓名？年龄？从哪里来？","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802031,"trial_step":31},{"step":31,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"……莱……莱纳德。今年30岁，我是个……工程师。我是狄斯人……外派到迪希尔……我本来要回家探亲的，路上遇到了砂盗。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802032,"trial_step":32},{"step":32,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"不管发生什么，时间到我这儿总会变成同一副模样。昨天，今天，明天，每一天……都不会改变。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802033,"trial_step":33},{"step":33,"content":"他把十多天前蓝鹫给他伪造的假身份报了出去。","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802034,"trial_step":34},{"step":34,"content":"他不知道蓝鹫说的迪希尔是什么地方，所以当守卫向他追问所在地细节的时候，他只能以体力透支，思维混乱来蒙混过去。","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802035,"trial_step":35},{"step":35,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"我是狄斯外派的工程师！我的家人还在等我！","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802036,"trial_step":36},{"step":36,"speaker":"守卫","content":"确认完身份会让你回去的，伸出手来。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802037,"trial_step":37},{"step":37,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"什么……","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802038,"trial_step":38},{"step":38,"content":"他呆呆地看着守卫拉过他的手，采集指纹和血液样本后用仪器比对，一股不祥的预感窜上脊背。","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802039,"trial_step":39},{"step":39,"speaker":"守卫","content":"这位先生，你的DNA信息显示，你叫莱曼。你也不是什么工程师，你是名在伍的外邦士兵。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802040,"trial_step":40},{"step":40,"content":"喀嚓一声，熟悉的枪械上膛声震动耳膜，黑洞洞的枪口直指莱曼。","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802041,"trial_step":41},{"step":41,"speaker":"守卫","content":"把手举起来！你现在被怀疑犯有间谍罪和非法入侵罪，我们将以狄斯边境防卫队的身份逮捕你！","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802042,"trial_step":42},{"step":42,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"这不可能！她答应过的，她说已经帮我……不，我，我不是什么莱曼，我就是莱纳德，我是狄斯的工程师！","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802043,"trial_step":43},{"step":43,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"看，这件衣服，这就是我们公司发的工作服，这衣服就是证明！","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802044,"trial_step":44},{"step":44,"speaker":"守卫","content":"“她”是谁！","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802045,"trial_step":45},{"step":45,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"她是……她，她是……","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802046,"trial_step":46},{"step":46,"content":"莱曼还没能从跋涉的绝境中抽离出来，只是茫然四望着。身体各处的肌肉抽动，似乎还想随着惯性动弹，最终变成了颤抖。","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802047,"trial_step":47},{"step":47,"content":"莱曼跪倒在地上，当他抬起头时，只能看到广场四周对着他的冰冷枪杆。","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802048,"trial_step":48},{"step":48,"content":"他一瞬间变得无比卑微。","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802049,"trial_step":49},{"step":49,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"求求你，求求你……放过我吧，放我进去吧！我不是间谍，我在砂海里爬了一个月才爬到这里啊！","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802050,"trial_step":50},{"step":50,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"我发誓我不会害狄斯的，我只是想过好日子，过没有狂厄和天灾的好日子而已！","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802051,"trial_step":51},{"step":51,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"对……对，你们可以把我关起来，调查清楚了再把我放出来！只要你们别把我送回去，我不想再回到地狱里了！","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802052,"trial_step":52},{"step":52,"content":"莱曼充满希冀地凝望着事务官那张养尊处优的脸，他这辈子见过的地位最高的军官都比他更沧桑，更风霜。","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802053,"trial_step":53},{"step":53,"content":"狄斯的富饶和安宁已经以最直观的方式展现在他面前。他可以把所有的尊严都丢掉，只求这位老爷给出一点“狄斯大邦”应有的宽容慈悲。","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802054,"trial_step":54},{"step":54,"speaker":"事务官","content":"很遗憾，莱曼先生。你的行为本就属于非法入境，更何况你是军人身份，会涉及到更加复杂的外邦政治条例。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802055,"trial_step":55},{"step":55,"speaker":"事务官","content":"所以我们会在通知你的城邦后将你遣送回去。但在那之前，我相信你可以在这里待上一阵子。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802056,"trial_step":56},{"step":56,"content":"事务性的理解和同情击碎了莱曼最后的希望，他的五官因恐惧和绝望扭曲了。","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802057,"trial_step":57},{"step":57,"speaker":"莱曼","content":"回去？不，我不回去，我会死在那里的！死在那个除了痛苦什么都没有的地方！","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802058,"trial_step":58},{"step":58,"content":"如果要死的话……如果要死的话！","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802059,"trial_step":59},{"step":59,"content":"他发狂般从地上跃起，挣脱束缚向着哨卡冲去。","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802060,"trial_step":60},{"step":60,"speaker":"守卫","content":"小心！他要冲卡！","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802061,"trial_step":61},{"step":61,"speaker":"事务官","content":"拦住他！狙击手准备。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802062,"trial_step":62},{"step":62,"content":"莱曼充耳不闻，他的眼中只有那一道脆弱的，似乎可以被轻易冲破的横栏。","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802063,"trial_step":63},{"step":63,"content":"在那里，就在那里。","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802064,"trial_step":64},{"step":64,"content":"所有人的梦想，一切的希望，支撑他走过砂海的绿洲和清泉，就在那里。","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802065,"trial_step":65},{"step":65,"content":"让我去吧，让我去啊！","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802066,"trial_step":66},{"step":66,"speaker":"？？？","content":"停下！！别去！！你会——","style":1,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802067,"trial_step":67},{"step":67,"content":"<size=55><color=#ff0000ff><b>——砰！</b></color></size>","style":3,"background":2005,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802068,"trial_step":68},{"step":68,"speaker":"蓝鹫","content":"——！","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802070,"trial_step":70},{"step":69,"content":"蓝鹫的笔尖一滑，信纸被撕裂，发出凄厉刺耳的声响。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802071,"trial_step":71},{"step":70,"content":"陪伴她十几天的笔和纸一同作废，像是在预示着什么。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802072,"trial_step":72},{"step":71,"speaker":"蓝鹫","content":"……破了啊。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802073,"trial_step":73},{"step":72,"speaker":"蓝鹫","content":"看来哪怕是换一个执笔人，结局也不会有什么改变。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802074,"trial_step":74},{"step":73,"content":"女人轻叹了口气，将废纸笔丢弃，索性放弃了继续书写。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802075,"trial_step":75},{"step":74,"content":"云雾在眼前飞舞又消散，恍惚间，她似乎见到了那些回忆中逝去的年轻面孔。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802076,"trial_step":76},{"step":75,"content":"那些曾经和她一同充满希望前往狄斯的人们，最后也是死在了路上。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802077,"trial_step":77},{"step":76,"content":"无论何时，都有为了虚无之梦押上性命的赌徒。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802078,"trial_step":78},{"step":77,"content":"一如既往……","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802079,"trial_step":79},{"step":78,"content":"一如既往。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802080,"trial_step":80},{"step":79,"speaker":"副手","content":"头儿，你怎么了吗？脸色有点难看。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802081,"trial_step":81},{"step":80,"speaker":"蓝鹫","content":"没什么，只是想到了点以前的事情。有什么事？","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_82"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802082,"trial_step":82},{"step":81,"speaker":"副手","content":"是！是我们……我们被包围了！","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_83"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802083,"trial_step":83},{"step":82,"speaker":"蓝鹫","content":"瞧你吓成这样，我们又不是第一次遇到砂盗了。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802084,"trial_step":84},{"step":83,"content":"见蓝鹫不以为意，副手压低了声音，神态焦急。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802085,"trial_step":85},{"step":84,"speaker":"副手","content":"不是，他们不是那些小贼，是来自狄斯城的FAC！说是……说是大姐头你和一起异邦逃兵偷渡案有关。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802086,"trial_step":86},{"step":85,"speaker":"副手","content":"他们给你扣了口挺大的锅，说是什么……“主导案件，意图扰、扰乱外邦关系”？要带你回去配合调查！","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802087,"trial_step":87},{"step":86,"speaker":"蓝鹫","content":"哦？狄斯的FAC？","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802088,"trial_step":88},{"step":87,"content":"蓝鹫流露出一丝意外，但这丝意外很快转换成了微带苦意的了悟。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802089,"trial_step":89},{"step":88,"speaker":"蓝鹫","content":"这时候找上来，也就只有那件事了吧。本来还想试试那个小朋友能不能改写故事的结局……看来还是不行。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802090,"trial_step":90},{"step":89,"speaker":"蓝鹫","content":"也罢，不管结果如何，交易就是交易，是我该履约交付的时候了。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802091,"trial_step":91},{"step":90,"speaker":"副手","content":"头儿！你真的要去吗？你要是走了，商队——","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802092,"trial_step":92},{"step":91,"content":"那抹苦涩的了悟似乎只是幻觉，下一秒，游刃有余的笑容就重又回到了女人脸上。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802093,"trial_step":93},{"step":92,"speaker":"蓝鹫","content":"不用急，对方只是希望我去配合调查而已，调查结束就会回来了。我不在的时候，你们就按之前约好的路线继续行动吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802094,"trial_step":94},{"step":93,"speaker":"蓝鹫","content":"虽然没了我给你们谈价钱，在买卖上会吃点亏……算了，你们练练吧，我也不指望你们赚多少，我不在的日子，不亏钱就行。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802095,"trial_step":95},{"step":94,"content":"此时已经入夜，晦暗光线下，各车队成员围坐在各自的篝火旁，做饭的手里拿着锅铲，吃饭的拿着碗勺，恶狠狠地盯着站在中央的FAC特派员们。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802096,"trial_step":96},{"step":95,"content":"似乎只要蓝鹫一声令下，周围的人就会抄起锅铲和勺子冲上来将这些士兵痛殴一顿。而商队的主人正是在这样的气氛中，施施然来到了FAC面前。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802097,"trial_step":97},{"step":96,"speaker":"FAC士兵","content":"你就是蓝鹫吧？请你跟我们回狄斯城，配合我们调查。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_98"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802098,"trial_step":98},{"step":97,"content":"火光映照之下，FAC士兵的面孔就像机械一般毫无变化，宣读调查令的语气也极其平板。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802099,"trial_step":99},{"step":98,"speaker":"蓝鹫","content":"没问题，配合官方调查是我一介商人应尽的义务。不过我有些好奇，你们是如何找到我的呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_100"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802100,"trial_step":100},{"step":99,"speaker":"FAC士兵","content":"这不是我们能回答的问题。你可以到了狄斯之后问相关负责人。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_101"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802101,"trial_step":101},{"step":100,"speaker":"蓝鹫","content":"太死板的家伙不受欢迎哦。那位MBCC的局长就比你们上道。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_102"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802102,"trial_step":102},{"step":101,"content":"她伸手制止了周围骚动的同伴们，微笑一如既往地温和。","style":3,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802103,"trial_step":103},{"step":102,"speaker":"蓝鹫","content":"那么，我们动身吧，猎犬们。","voice":["vo_trial_50802_1_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_vautour_trial","style":1,"background":1007,"log_type":1,"src_id":150802104,"trial_step":104}]}